        },
        {
          "text": " Eliyaani waan jed'eeni, Yo anini nama Waaqa taate, ibidi ha gubba gad'ufe siifi jara kankele balleesu! Hojuma suni ibidi gadi bue namichafi jara isaa hobaase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.10",
