          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaikaani AABBO Waaqa waan Eliyaani jette, Insodaatini, beeni gabui, isa woliini yaa. Jennaani Eliyaani kae, namicha kaani woliini gara hayyu d'aqe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan jed'eeni, wonti AABBO Waaqi sini jed'u tana: Waan atini Baal-Zebubu Waaqa Ekroniti nama ergiteefi — aka waan Israeli keesa Waaqi nami kad'atu injirre — atini amma infayyitu, indoota.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
